<title>USA: Omaha hogs $0.25 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $0.25 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.25 higher. Top $55.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-270 lbs    55.00-55.25, instances 55.50</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. Steady. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    45.00</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    46.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    49.00</p>
